== Discord Functions
func getMembers()
	Returns a slice of member objects of users in the guild

func sendTargetDM(userID)
	Sends the target a DM

func sendTargetDMRetID(userID)
	Sends the target a DM and returns the messageID

func cfileUpload(opts...)
	Creates a file upload components

== Roblox Functions
func getRobloxGroupByID(groupID)
	Returns the full Roblox group object specified by the arguments.

func getRobloxUserByID(userID)
	Returns the full Roblox user object specified by the arguments.

func getRobloxUserByUsername(username)
	Returns the full Roblox user object specified by the arguments.

func updateMemberRole(groupID, memberID, roleID)
	Updates & returns the members role